## Project Description
The project is a Honkai Star Rail fangame where the player goes on a date with Firefly and goes ghostbusting with Guinaifen.

## User / Integrator Experience
The player goes on a date with Firefly and goes ghostbusting with Guinaifen. On the date with Firefly, the player goes through the Luofu together with Firefly. After the date, the player goes ghostbusting with Guinaifen and finds out the Firefly they were hanging out
with is a ghost. It is the lingering spirit of the Firefly in the player's memories who was unable to resolve her inner regrets about her death. The player busts the ghost. After the end, the player recieves a message from the real Firefly.

## System Description
The project takes place in the Luofu. Environments will be handmade by me. The player controls the Trailblazer who interacts with Firefly and Guinaifen.

## Explicit Dependency
The critical condition of the game is that it is a Honkai Star Rail fangame. The game would not work if it was not about Honkai Star Rail.
